OL,3,GNEWSABackbencher fears lack of
OL,4,Agovernment scrutiny
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Jersey backbencher has accused
OL,7,Fdeputies of being too "passive" and is
OL,8,Fconcerned a shifting political tide in
OL,9,Fthe assembly means the government will
OL,10,Fnot be held to account.
OL,12,FThe new political term, which began in
OL,13,FJune, has had a slow start since
OL,14,Fpoliticians returned from summer recess
OL,15,Fwith the last three assembly sittings
OL,16,Fonly lasting a few hours while
OL,17,Fpoliticians have debated four
OL,18,Fproposals.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
