OL,3,GNEWSABackbencher fears lack of
OL,4,Agovernment scrutiny
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Max Andrews said the slow pace
OL,7,Fwas due to backbenchers being more
OL,8,Fideologically aligned with the
OL,9,Fgovernment but others disagreed and
OL,10,Fargued members were working hard.
OL,12,FChief Minister Lyndon Farnham said the
OL,13,Fgovernment was "focused on developing a
OL,14,Fprogramme that is deliverable and
OL,15,Fproperly funded".
